B.a7j=new A.db("07_dispatched",7,"Order Dispatched & Tracking","dispatched","*Order Dispatched Successfully!* \u2705\n\n\u0d28\u0d2e\u0d38\u0d4d\u0d15\u0d3e\u0d30\u0d02! \u0d24\u0d3e\u0d19\u0d4d\u0d15\u0d33\u0d41\u0d1f\u0d46 *{{pack_summary}}* \u0d35\u0d3f\u0d1c\u0d2f\u0d15\u0d30\u0d2e\u0d3e\u0d2f\u0d3f *{{courier_name}}* \u0d35\u0d34\u0d3f \u0d21\u0d3f\u0d38\u0d4d\u0d2a\u0d3e\u0d1a\u0d4d\u0d1a\u0d4d \u0d1a\u0d46\u0d2f\u0d4d\u0d24\u0d3f\u0d30\u0d3f\u0d15\u0d4d\u0d15\u0d41\u0d28\u0d4d\u0d28\u0d41.\n\n*Tracking ID:* {{tracking_id}}\n\n\u0d1f\u0d4d\u0d30\u0d3e\u0d15\u0d4d\u0d15\u0d4d \u0d1a\u0d46\u0d2f\u0d4d\u0d2f\u0d3e\u0d28\u0d41\u0d33\u0d4d\u0d33 \u0d32\u0d3f\u0d19\u0d4d\u0d15\u0d4d:\n{{tracking_url}}\n\n\u0d38\u0d3e\u0d27\u0d3e\u0d30\u0d23\u0d2f\u0d3e\u0d2f\u0d3f 2-5 Working Days-\u0d28\u0d41\u0d33\u0d4d\u0d33\u0d3f\u0d7d \u0d21\u0d46\u0d32\u0d3f\u0d35\u0d31\u0d3f \u0d32\u0d2d\u0d3f\u0d15\u0d4d\u0d15\u0d41\u0d02.\n\nWebsite: {{website}}\nInstagram: {{instagram_handle}}\n\n*{{brand_name}}*\n`{{tagline}}`","*Order Dispatched Successfully!* \u2705\n\nHello! Your *{{pack_summary}}* has been dispatched via *{{courier_name}}*.\n\n*Tracking ID:* {{tracking_id}}\n\nTrack your shipment here:\n{{tracking_url}}\n\nEstimated delivery: 2-5 working days.\n\nWebsite: {{website}}\nInstagram: {{instagram_handle}}\n\n*{{brand_name}}*\n`{{tagline}}`","*Order Dispatched Successfully!* \u2705\n\nNamaskaram! Thankalude *{{pack_summary}}* *{{courier_name}}* vazhi dispatch cheythirikkunnu.\n\n*Tracking ID:* {{tracking_id}}\n\nStatus check cheyyan ee link upayogikkam:\n{{tracking_url}}\n\n2-5 Working Days-nullil delivery labhikkum.\n\nWebsite: {{website}}\nInstagram: {{instagram_handle}}\n\n*{{brand_name}}*\n`{{tagline}}`","",!1,null)
